# Pairs with BulkHintBound. Issue #5706 (review B1 of #5702): a commit admitted
# before the narrow and allocated below the hint is stored after the copy, outside
# the old leaf's span, so no leaf applies it.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundNarrowWithoutDrain
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the narrow does not drain the commits the old leaf admitted before it
PERTURBS: Narrow

--- FIND
    /\ narrowed \/ ~(cst = "flight" /\ cCounted)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no drain.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
